 (eqm_fromgeqdsk call)
 adjust boundary so that minimum local curvature is at least
     0.075000 * [the midplane half-width of the plasma]

 --> eqm_fromgeqdsk sets up xplasma g-eqdsk data: g103875.nstx
     (note eqm_fromgeqdsk can also acquire EFIT data
     over the network from standard EFIT MDSplus trees).

  
  ...reading & converting G-eqdsk... 
   *** minimum normalized curvature =  7.406235990313909E-02
  %eqi_contour:  contour violates sharp curvature limit.
   ...reducing psi(bdy) to find closed contour.  Now fbdy= 0.9975000000000001
 %eqi_contour:  contour angular velocity reversed.
   ...reducing psi(bdy) to find closed contour.  Now fbdy= 0.9950062500000001
   *** minimum normalized curvature =  5.957630161547050E-02
  %eqi_contour:  contour violates sharp curvature limit.
   ...reducing psi(bdy) to find closed contour.  Now fbdy= 0.9925187343750002
   *** minimum normalized curvature =  7.311469331835467E-02
  %eqi_contour:  contour violates sharp curvature limit.
   ...reducing psi(bdy) to find closed contour.  Now fbdy= 0.9900374375390627
   *** minimum normalized curvature =  7.128731453097500E-02
  %eqi_contour:  contour violates sharp curvature limit.
   ...reducing psi(bdy) to find closed contour.  Now fbdy= 0.9875623439452151
   *** minimum normalized curvature =  7.463379153212076E-02
